    "nextStep": "Ask to participate in one meeting, assignment, or opportunity where your contribution belongs.",
    "whyItMatters": "Johnson's calculations supported the transition from experimental flight to human space travel, including missions that placed Americans in orbit and helped reach the Moon.",
