    "carouselAuthored": "SLIDE 1 --- The system limited where she could study and work.\n\nSLIDE 2 --- Katherine Johnson's family moved so she could continue her\neducation.\n\nSLIDE 3 --- She joined a segregated computing unit at NASA's\npredecessor.\n\nSLIDE 4 --- She asked to enter meetings where women had not\ntraditionally been included.\n\nSLIDE 5 --- Her mathematics guided America's early human spaceflights.\n\nSLIDE 6 --- John Glenn asked her to verify the computer's calculations\nbefore orbit.\n\nSLIDE 7 --- THE REELSPIRATION --- Make the quality of your work\nimpossible to ignore.",
