    "carouselAuthored": "SLIDE 1 --- His ability was never the problem. Access was.\n\nSLIDE 2 --- Segregated schooling left Percy Julian underprepared for\ncollege.\n\nSLIDE 3 --- He caught up and graduated as valedictorian.\n\nSLIDE 4 --- Racism continued to limit academic and industrial\nopportunities.\n\nSLIDE 5 --- He achieved landmark work in synthetic chemistry.\n\nSLIDE 6 --- He later founded a successful research company of his own.\n\nSLIDE 7 --- THE REELSPIRATION --- Talent deserves access, not another\nobstacle course.",
