    "carouselAuthored": "SLIDE 1 --- He had limited schooling---but kept educating himself.\n\nSLIDE 2 --- Garrett Morgan mastered machines and built his own\nbusinesses.\n\nSLIDE 3 --- He designed a safety hood for smoke and toxic air.\n\nSLIDE 4 --- He used the device during a dangerous tunnel rescue.\n\nSLIDE 5 --- Racism still made buyers resist a lifesaving invention.\n\nSLIDE 6 --- He later developed a safer three-position traffic signal.\n\nSLIDE 7 --- THE REELSPIRATION --- Keep proving the solution until\nprejudice loses its excuse.",
