    "carouselAuthored": "SLIDE 1 --- A sudden illness escalated into organ failure.\n\nSLIDE 2 --- Medical complications led to amputation.\n\nSLIDE 3 --- Recovery continued over years, not one triumphant moment.\n\nSLIDE 4 --- Wasser returned to work and movement with prosthetics.\n\nSLIDE 5 --- She turned testimony toward public health education.\n\nSLIDE 6 --- The warning became larger than the individual story.\n\nSLIDE 7 --- THE REELSPIRATION --- Share the warning accurately enough to\nprotect someone else.",
