    "reelScriptAuthored": "Brendan Fraser was once one of Hollywood's most recognizable stars. Then\ninjuries, surgeries, personal hardship, and career disruption moved him\naway from the center of the industry. Years passed, and many people\nassumed his biggest roles belonged to the past. Fraser kept working.\nWhen he returned in The Whale, he did not try to recreate the adventure\nhero audiences remembered. He delivered a vulnerable performance that\nearned the Academy Award for Best Actor. Today's Reelspiration: you are\nnot finished simply because the room stopped looking in your direction.\nA comeback may not look like becoming your old self again. It may look\nlike finally being seen for who you have become.",
